# worker: the closed list of states of the machine "Worker".
# value<TAB>mark (initial, final or -)<TAB>kind (active, waiting, rest, final)<TAB>meaning
starting	initial	active	the agent session is coming up
working	-	active	the agent works on the ticket
waiting	-	waiting	the agent waits for someone, and said who
done	-	rest	the agent reported done and its turn ended
lost	-	waiting	the session shows no sign of life
exited	final	final	the session is over
